  "question": {
    "text": "If the normals at two points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> meets again on the parabola, where <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "h0RBO",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
