      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;and both the normals again meets on the parabola,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>On solving, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
